162
00:25:29,167 --> 00:25:31,583
We had to dig for some yams to eat .

163
00:25:37,333 --> 00:25:38,958
It was really difficult , my dear .

164
00:25:42,917 --> 00:25:46,292
And the wilderness was dreadful there .

165
00:25:47,583 --> 00:25:48,750
Many died from jungle fever .

166
00:25:50,208 --> 00:25:51,458
Then cholera spread widely .

167
00:25:52,708 --> 00:25:55,583
So many soldiers lost their lives .

168
00:25:56,208 --> 00:25:59,000
What about you ? Did anything happen to you ?

169
00:26:00,750 --> 00:26:01,750
During the fight ,

170
00:26:02,542 --> 00:26:04,000
I was slashed in the chest .

171
00:26:05,542 --> 00:26:06,667
Almost didn 't make it .

172
00:26:07,125 --> 00:26:10,125
Fortunately , Somdet Wat Rakhang saved my life .

173
00:26:11,125 --> 00:26:12,125
Otherwise ,

174
00:26:12,833 --> 00:26:14,250
I would have died .

175
00:26:29,875 --> 00:26:31,167
But poor Prik !

176
00:26:32,750 --> 00:26:33,917
He 's gone too soon .

177
00:26:35,542 --> 00:26:37,000
What ? Prik is dead ?

178
00:26:40,292 --> 00:26:41,625
