179
00:26:42,792 --> 00:26:44,208
He died right in front of me .

180
00:26:45,583 --> 00:26:48,333
His body was burnt like he was nobody .

181
00:26:50,167 --> 00:26:51,208
Oh , his poor soul .

182
00:26:57,333 --> 00:26:58,333
